POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

::: body json
{ "name": "{{userName}}", "email": "{{userEmail}}" }

::: post
test("201 with a Location header", () => {
  expect(res.status).toBe(201);
  expect(res.headers.get("location")).toMatch(/^\/users\/\d+$/);
});
env.set("userId", String(res.json().id));

::: docs
Stores the new id as `userId` for the next requests.
